"Jozz is Stuart's older brother, from the family's last child group, and an Artonan knight."
"His knight skill is Whisperer of Refuge, chosen partly to complement his sister Sina's skill."
"A painting of him waiting for his squad hangs in Rapport School's top library."
"He nitpicked the painter until she once excused herself, and is proud the school shows it."
"He has pink eyes and works subtlety and illusion magic, such as spells to go unnoticed."
"He failed on Goldbush and must bind again; he says a wizard and an Avowed can't be friends."
"His Whisperer of Refuge resembles Alden's skill; he is picky and was rude about Alden."
"His refuge keeps its area healthy, hides him from demons and anchors restoration."
